273	     * unfinished order. The hull is what the account buys when no role on any planet wanted anything --
274	     * a habit rather than an errand -- so a login that finds the yard busy leaves it alone instead of
275	     * stacking a second identical batch behind the first (ARB-001: units ordered on eight of six logins).
276	     * The wall, the cargo and the probes above keep their orders: those are the errands.
277	     */
278	    private function scheduleShipyard(AiProfile $profile, AiWorkItem $sessionWorkItem, CarbonImmutable $dueAt, ?QueueableUnit $plan): void
279	    {
