257	        // executor asks the same gate (`QueueAiBuildingAction`). Not asked here, the pass offers a
258	        // step the executor then refuses: the planet spends its one step on a refusal, queues
259	        // nothing, and still reads buildable to the planner -- idle while called buildable (live:
260	        // player 44, 4 of 4 planets). Asking it here lets the planet fall through to its next
